      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Before clicking on the “Play” button try to join Popcorn Palace from the Home Screen that shows when you first open the app. When you try to join this way you’ll receive a pop up message that says:\n\nLoad experimental world?\n\nAn iOS version of this world hasn't been uploaded yet. We can attempt to load the Android version with an experimental system, but there may be problems. Do you want to continue?\n\nThis text only shows up if you try to join the world from the Home Screen of the app. It doesn’t show when trying to join from the in game menu. If you ARE able to get the world to load the shaders will look like the second picture and you’ll crash after loading due to the aforementioned reason.",
